  "description": "Herald observability metapackage tuned for paid-tier games. Pulls in the network transports (HttpJson / TcpJsonLine / UdpJsonLine), the Enterprise HTTP observability sinks (Seq, Splunk, Honeycomb, Datadog, Loki, SignalFx), Sentry for crash tracking, the generic-webhook sink, and the OTLP trio. PagerDuty, Elasticsearch, and Slack are deliberately excluded — those are business/on-call surfaces rather than game-side.",
